000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. TSTRMCLS.
000400 AUTHOR. KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.    SEPTEMBER 9, 1987.
000600*REMARKS.
000700
000800**************************************************************
000900*                                                            *
001000*   T S T R M C L S   THIS IS AN ONLINE PROGRAM THAT         *
001100*    LAUNCHES THE JOB THAT PERFORMS THE FINAL CLOSING        *
001200*    PROCEDURES.  THE JOB IS 'BXFINCLS'.                     *
001300*    ALSO NEXT MONTHS NEW CUTOFF DATE IS ALSO ENTERED AND    *
001400*    UPDATED FOR NEXT MONTHS CLOSING.  THIS
001500*    PROCEDURE IS PART OF THE MONTH-END CLOSING PROCEDURE    *
001600*    FOR THE CORPORATE STORES ACCOUNTING SYSTEM (CSAS)       *
001700*                                                            *
001800**************************************************************
001900
      *C  17SEP1993      DAVE PLUM
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO SET THE NEW FIELD MACCT-FINCLS-SW TO "Y" TO
      *C  TO INDICATE THAT FINAL CLOSE PROCESSING HAS BEGUN.
      *C
      *C  06OCT1998      JIM COFFMAN
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO SET THE MONTH END CLOSING TIME TO '190000'
      *C  INSTEAD OF '240000' AT UNION CITY PER LINDA LEWIS' REQUEST.
      *C  THIS IS TO BRING THEM MORE IN LINE WITH THEIR CHANGING TO
      *C  CONTINUOUS OPERATIONS. REVISED CLOSING TIME TO 070000 ON
      *C  LINDA'S REQUEST 1/5/2001.
002000
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.    I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
002500
002600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSTRMCLS-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT MACTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MACTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
002700
002800 DATA DIVISION.
002900 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC           PIC X(2000).
       FD  MACTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0101.
       FD  MACTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACTINFO-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0101.
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0501.

