           05  QCMDEXC-BBALWOFF.
               10  STRDBRDR-BXFINCLS   PIC X(36) VALUE
               "STRDBRDR FILE(QJOBSRC) MBR(BXFINCLS)".
               10  DBR-BXFINCLS-PARM2 PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 36.
           05  OVERRIDE-ZSTRMCLS      PIC X(34) VALUE
               "OVRDSPF FILE(ZSTRMCLS) SHARE(*YES)".
           05  OVERRIDE-PARM2         PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 34.

       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGUAGE IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD  IN COPYLIB.
017000
017100
017200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
017300
017400 PROC-DIV SECTION 01.
017500
017600 BEGIN-HERE.
017700     PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-H-X.
017800
017900     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.
018000
018100     PERFORM 2-EOJ  THRU 2-EOJ-X.
018200
018300     GOBACK.
018400
018500 1-HSK.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVERRIDE-ZSTRMCLS, OVERRIDE-PARM2.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.

           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I, MACTINFO-I.
           OPEN I-O   MACTINFO-O.
023600
023700**************************************************
023800*                                                *
023900*   GET CO. FROM MPLTINFO                        *
024000*   USING 'P 01' AS THE ARGUMENT                 *
024100*                                                *
024200**************************************************
024300
024400     MOVE "P 01"  TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO  PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO 1-HSK P 01"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE PLT-ARG             TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               MOVE BASE                TO  ACCTG-BASE
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
025200     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY        TO  COMPANY-SAVE.
025300
025400 1-H-X.
025500     EXIT.
025600
025700 2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I, MACTINFO-I, MACTINFO-O.
028600
028700 2-EOJ-X.
028800      EXIT.
028900
029000******************************************************
029100**                                                  **
029200**   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
029300**                                                  **
029400******************************************************
029500
029600 2-BLOWUP.
029700     MOVE "TSTRMCLS"              TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
029800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING ACCTG-BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
029900         VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
030000                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
030100
030200 2-BLOWUP-X.
030300     EXIT.
030400
033100
033200 4-PGM-ERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND(99), IND(FIELD-NUMBER).
034000
034100 4-PGM-ERROR-X.
034200     EXIT.
036300
036400**************************************************
