067100*         "MONTH END CUTOFF"
067200         MOVE 14                  TO  LANG-SETNUM
067300         MOVE 112                 TO  LANG-MSGNUM
067400         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER      TO  DE2-MSGLINE
067500         MOVE 15                  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
067600         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
067700         GO TO 62-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-2.
067800
067900
